{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":2,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Vp68b9g9kR2cYvyQBdGBbq","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/private/tmp/trial-pi-80-ztx8nr2b/.xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_100k.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nfact = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census population data\nref = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Filter farmers markets to exclude territories\nfact_excluding_territories = fact.filter(\n    (fact.state_name != 'Puerto Rico') & (fact.state_name != 'Virgin Islands')\n)\n\n# Get total farmers markets\ntotal_markets = fact_excluding_territories.aggregate(\n    total_markets=fact_excluding_territories.farmers_markets.sum()\n)\n\n# Get US population\nus_population = ref.filter(ref.NAME == 'United States').select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n\n# Create constant keys for join\ntotal_markets_with_key = total_markets.mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\nus_pop_with_key = us_population.mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n\n# Join and calculate the ratio\nexpr = (\n    total_markets_with_key.join(us_pop_with_key, total_markets_with_key.k == us_pop_with_key.k)\n      .mutate(markets_per_100k=total_markets_with_key.total_markets / us_pop_with_key.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n      .select('total_markets', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'markets_per_100k')\n)\n"}}}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see that \"Puerto Rico\" and \"Virgin Islands\" are territories that should be excluded. Let me also check if there are others. The 50 states + DC = 51 items that are not territories. Let me count how many are listed and identify which ones are territories.\n\nFrom what I can see:\n- Puerto Rico is a territory\n- Virgin Islands is a territory\n\nSo I need to sum farmers_markets where state_name is not in ('Puerto Rico', 'Virgin Islands'). Let me do that and create a build script that calculates the final metric.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I can see Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands are territories. Let me create a build script to compute the farmers markets per 100,000 residents metric, excluding territories:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Vp68b9g9kR2cYvyQBdGBbq","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/private/tmp/trial-pi-80-ztx8nr2b/.xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_100k.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener()\n_o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]\nu.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\n# Read farmers markets data\nfact = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Read census population data\nref = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con,\n    table_name=\"census_population\",\n    storage_options=so\n)\n\n# Filter farmers markets to exclude territories\nfact_excluding_territories = fact.filter(\n    (fact.state_name != 'Puerto Rico') & (fact.state_name != 'Virgin Islands')\n)\n\n# Get total farmers markets\ntotal_markets = fact_excluding_territories.aggregate(\n    total_markets=fact_excluding_territories.farmers_markets.sum()\n)\n\n# Get US population\nus_population = ref.filter(ref.NAME == 'United States').select('POPESTIMATE2025')\n\n# Create constant keys for join\ntotal_markets_with_key = total_markets.mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\nus_pop_with_key = us_population.mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n\n# Join and calculate the ratio\nexpr = (\n    total_markets_with_key.join(us_pop_with_key, total_markets_with_key.k == us_pop_with_key.k)\n      .mutate(markets_per_100k=total_markets_with_key.total_markets / us_pop_with_key.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n      .select('total_markets', 'POPESTIMATE2025', 'markets_per_100k')\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":13,"output":841,"cacheRead":18215,"cacheWrite":462,"totalTokens":19531,"cost":{"input":0.000013,"output":0.004205,"cacheRead":0.0018215000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.0005775,"total":0.0066170000000000005},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":128},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912901855,"responseId":"msg_011Ce75MuSMuaAGDnNo3Y7DU","rawStopReason":"tool_use"}}
